    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BrAInstorm is a high-stakes fast pace sci-fi Adventure that takes place in\u00a0<strong>Dr. Kairo Mnemorix\u2019s </strong>mind, the brilliant scientist who created Z.E.K.E, a super-intelligent AI destined to reshape the galaxy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of one of\u00a0Dr. Kairo's daughters as you travel inside his mind to destroy the tumor that plagues him. Can you withstand the images of the mind while trying to save\u00a0Dr. Kairo Mnemorix?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in this sci-fi shoot-em-up your task besides saving the Doctor is dodging and defeating the enemies that you'll face. with challenging bullet patterns and funky visuals this bullet hell is created to be confusing but fun to play.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHARACTERS:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367900/extras/6ef12730334e5974b777754db655ac05.avif?t=1738769670\" data-has-big width=800 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367900/extras/50bff1b05b74d4330f38ff3361791d3c.avif?t=1738769670\" data-has-big width=800 height=352 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367900/extras/5afda6edd28477a68f3ab2cb10c4d370.avif?t=1738769670\" data-has-big width=800 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
